{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOGTAGON</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRIVE. CRASH. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Hogtagon \u2013 a brutal vehicular battleground where only the strongest survive. In this high-octane driving sumo-inspired game, 2-8 players battle in deadly arena to be the last vehicle standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHAOS ON WHEELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command powerful vehicles in a desperate struggle for dominance. Master the art of vehicular combat as you strategically ram, push, and outmaneuver your opponents, sending them flying into the abyss below. Every collision brings you closer to victory \u2013 or doom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Vehicular Sumo Battles</strong>: Crash, smash and bash your opponents off the arena in fast-paced matches where quick reflexes and tactical thinking determine the champion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong>: Play free-for-all or team-based matches with 2-8 players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Responsive Physics</strong>: Experience realistic collision mechanics that make every impact feel powerful and consequential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hogtagon awaits. Will you seize glory or be hurled into oblivion?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635050?t=1745422871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635050/5306175716957563d9724c31023957c464a4e529/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745422871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635050/63aaffeb744f8e56c2c0f10907153f4bbf2aade4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745422871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635050/63aaffeb744f8e56c2c0f10907153f4bbf2aade4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745422871","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOGTAGON</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DRIVE. CRASH. SURVIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Hogtagon \u2013 a brutal vehicular battleground where only the strongest survive. In this high-octane driving sumo-inspired game, 2-8 players battle in deadly arena to be the last vehicle standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHAOS ON WHEELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command powerful vehicles in a desperate struggle for dominance. Master the art of vehicular combat as you strategically ram, push, and outmaneuver your opponents, sending them flying into the abyss below. Every collision brings you closer to victory \u2013 or doom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Vehicular Sumo Battles</strong>: Crash, smash and bash your opponents off the arena in fast-paced matches where quick reflexes and tactical thinking determine the champion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong>: Play free-for-all or team-based matches with 2-8 players online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Responsive Physics</strong>: Experience realistic collision mechanics that make every impact feel powerful and consequential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Hogtagon awaits. Will you seize glory or be hurled into oblivion?</p>","developers":["Octagon Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://sha